============================================================
  n=3: W=8, 2^{C(1,2)-1} = 2^-1 = 0.5, product = 4, Sigma_H = 4 ✓
  n=4: W=32, 2^{C(2,2)-1} = 2^0 = 1, product = 32, Sigma_H = 32 ✓
  n=5: W=158, 2^{C(3,2)-1} = 2^2 = 4, product = 632, Sigma_H = 632 ✓
