  n=7: W=6350, 2^{C(5,2)-1} = 2^9 = 512, product = 3251200, Sigma_H = 3251200 ✓

  PREDICTION: Sigma_H(8) = W(8) * 2^{C(6,2)-1} = 49752 * 2^14 = 815136768
  mean_H(8) = Sigma_H(8) / 2^21 = 815136768 / 2097152 = 388.6875
  Also = W(8) / 2^7 = 49752 / 128 = 388.6875
